                  <span class="gh">Notifications</span>
                  <div class="gnote n-success"><svg class="ni" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Library sync complete</div>
